{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"GDevelop.GDevelop","latestVersion":"5.6.287","media":{"icons":[{"mimeType":"image/png","path":"media/icon.f0d4d9b5.png","priority":1,"sha256":"f0d4d9b5796447146c4793ffb0b9b9fcdf462b05405b86815ce238aad27a359d","source":"winget-legacy"}],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"author":"Florian Rival","copyright":"Copyright (c) 2026-present Florian Rival","description":"The fastest, easiest, most powerful no-code game engine.","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/4ian/GDevelop/blob/HEAD/LICENSE.md","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"author":"Florian Rival","copyright":"Copyright (c) 2026-present Florian Rival","description":"The fastest, easiest, most powerful no-code game engine.","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/4ian/GDevelop/blob/HEAD/LICENSE.md","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"GDevelop is a free, open-source game engine that's 10x easier and faster to use than anything else. Build from anywhere — even on your phone. Publish everywhere: iOS, Android, Steam, web, gaming platforms. Reach millions of players or create the next hit game you've been dreaming of.","moniker":"gdevelop","name":"GDevelop","packageUrl":"https://gdevelop.io/","privacyUrl":"https://gdevelop.io/page/privacy-policy","publisher":"GDevelop Team","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/4ian/GDevelop/issues","publisherUrl":"http://www.florianrival.com/","purchaseUrl":"https://gdevelop.io/pricing","releaseNotes":"💝 Improvements\n- Gold & Pro premium subscribers now get every month a free game template to claim, in addition to a free asset pack.\n- Education subscribers now get a free seat: the plan holder is not counted toward the seat total anymore.\n- Bundles, game templates and asset packs can now be bought as a gift. Once purchased, forward the email or the activation link to gift the product.\n🐛 Bug fixes\n- Fix performance issue on Windows/some GPUs by disabling stencil buffer resolution in render targets.\n- Fix applying image smoothing changes to the scene editor.\n⚙️ Extensions\n- [Community][Playgama Bridge]\n  - Multiplayer (SaaS): new bridge.multiplayer module for real-time games\n  - Platform updates (Y8: integration updated to the new Y8 SDK, MSN: SDK update, player avatar, ad fix, YouTube: ad block detection fix, Playgama: support for social methods)\n- [Reviewed][3D terrain] Make the ground faster to draw on slower graphics cards (v0.2.0)\n  - Also add an advanced \"Anisotropic filtering\" property (4x by default, as before).\n🎨 Assets\n- New effect packs for objects & layers\n- Add 3 new audio packs from Elv\n  - Add the Electronic Game Music Pack\n  - Add the 8-BIT Battle Music Pack\n  - Add the 16-BIT RPG Music Pack\n🕹 Examples\n- Add a new free 3D Air Hockey example\n- Use the new 3D actions/conditions in the 3D tank, haunted house and GTA starters\n- Stop the expanded 3D starters from freezing while boxes move, and load them faster\n🕹 Premium Game Templates\n- Update the game template: Advanced Transitions by Vegetato\n  - Fixed a bug where using multi transitions in the same scene causes the\n    extension to create huge amount of shape painter instances.\n  - Fixed an issue where shape painter object instances stays in the scene\n    after the transition has finished.","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/4ian/GDevelop/releases/tag/v5.6.287","tags":["develop","development","game"]},"zh-CN":{"author":"Florian Rival","copyright":"Copyright (c) 2026-present Florian Rival","description":"最快、最简单、最强大的无代码游戏引擎。","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/4ian/GDevelop/blob/HEAD/LICENSE.md","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"GDevelop 是一款免费的开源游戏引擎，使用起来比其它任何引擎都要简单和快速 10 倍。在任何地方都能创建，甚至是在手机上。在任何地方都能发布：iOS、Android、Steam、网页和游戏平台。与数百万玩家见面，或制作下一款你梦寐以求的热门游戏。","name":"GDevelop","packageUrl":"https://gdevelop.io/","privacyUrl":"https://gdevelop.io/page/privacy-policy","publisher":"GDevelop Team","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/4ian/GDevelop/issues","publisherUrl":"http://www.florianrival.com/","purchaseUrl":"https://gdevelop.io/pricing","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/4ian/GDevelop/releases/tag/v5.6.287","tags":["开发"]}},"longDescription":"GDevelop is a free, open-source game engine that's 10x easier and faster to use than anything else. Build from anywhere — even on your phone. Publish everywhere: iOS, Android, Steam, web, gaming platforms. Reach millions of players or create the next hit game you've been dreaming of.","moniker":"gdevelop","name":"GDevelop","packageUrl":"https://gdevelop.io/","privacyUrl":"https://gdevelop.io/page/privacy-policy","publisher":"GDevelop Team","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/4ian/GDevelop/issues","publisherUrl":"http://www.florianrival.com/","purchaseUrl":"https://gdevelop.io/pricing","releaseNotes":"💝 Improvements\n- Gold & Pro premium subscribers now get every month a free game template to claim, in addition to a free asset pack.\n- Education subscribers now get a free seat: the plan holder is not counted toward the seat total anymore.\n- Bundles, game templates and asset packs can now be bought as a gift. Once purchased, forward the email or the activation link to gift the product.\n🐛 Bug fixes\n- Fix performance issue on Windows/some GPUs by disabling stencil buffer resolution in render targets.\n- Fix applying image smoothing changes to the scene editor.\n⚙️ Extensions\n- [Community][Playgama Bridge]\n  - Multiplayer (SaaS): new bridge.multiplayer module for real-time games\n  - Platform updates (Y8: integration updated to the new Y8 SDK, MSN: SDK update, player avatar, ad fix, YouTube: ad block detection fix, Playgama: support for social methods)\n- [Reviewed][3D terrain] Make the ground faster to draw on slower graphics cards (v0.2.0)\n  - Also add an advanced \"Anisotropic filtering\" property (4x by default, as before).\n🎨 Assets\n- New effect packs for objects & layers\n- Add 3 new audio packs from Elv\n  - Add the Electronic Game Music Pack\n  - Add the 8-BIT Battle Music Pack\n  - Add the 16-BIT RPG Music Pack\n🕹 Examples\n- Add a new free 3D Air Hockey example\n- Use the new 3D actions/conditions in the 3D tank, haunted house and GTA starters\n- Stop the expanded 3D starters from freezing while boxes move, and load them faster\n🕹 Premium Game Templates\n- Update the game template: Advanced Transitions by Vegetato\n  - Fixed a bug where using multi transitions in the same scene causes the\n    extension to create huge amount of shape painter instances.\n  - Fixed an issue where shape painter object instances stays in the scene\n    after the transition has finished.","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/4ian/GDevelop/releases/tag/v5.6.287","tags":["develop","development","game"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/5.6.287/app.json","detailSha256":"78dbd292f0d37fc3ce0609389e5c72db68996a3a21d00c594defb0e54c533b16","releaseDate":"2026-11-04","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"5.6.287"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/5.6.286/app.json","detailSha256":"8628e0df812f38f3dc4ddcdfc54fd76dd53236cf40014036fd02a7f680e7895d","releaseDate":"2026-11-02","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"5.6.286"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/5.6.285/app.json","detailSha256":"512fecbe294d36fcde21604076e4c73359a534f37f10d6e4c77f9d5e76745e93","releaseDate":"2026-10-21","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"5.6.285"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/5.6.284/app.json","detailSha256":"77daabae4d780746b8430c4d281b4972f9db7054a14408028439ef13d7b9e869","releaseDate":"2026-10-14","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"5.6.284"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/5.6.283/app.json","detailSha256":"fbae0def0a7d91ce74b151d06f893ecffeddc2f7365991712c8d53f2f5273218","releaseDate":"2026-09-29","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"5.6.283"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/5.6.282/app.json","detailSha256":"1f1fd9f5045069867d3871e